# S-Pen Enhancement Details
# Core Options Added:
# - snes9x_spen_tap_action: Configure S-Pen tap behavior (left_click/right_click/middle_click/trigger/reload/disabled)
# - snes9x_spen_barrel_action: Configure S-Pen barrel button behavior (left_click/right_click/middle_click/trigger/reload/disabled)  
# - snes9x_spen_hover_behavior: Configure hover behavior (cursor/active_cursor/lightgun_tracking/disabled)
# - snes9x_spen_coordinate_mode: Choose coordinate system (absolute/relative)
# - snes9x_spen_input_mode: Select input detection mode (auto/mouse/lightgun)
#
# Features:
# - Full RetroArch RETRO_DEVICE_POINTER compliance
# - Virtual pointer system for barrel button detection
# - Hover support for lightgun tracking
# - Coordinate system transformation for proper screen mapping
# - Legacy multi-touch compatibility preserved
# - Auto-detection of S-Pen vs traditional input